### 1. Frontend Auth Module (NEW)

#### [NEW] [auth.js](file:///c:/Users/54321/Desktop/jit%202%20sql%20server/src/lib/auth.js)

Modul autentikasi frontend baru (vanilla JS, bukan TypeScript) yang menangani:
- `login(username, password)` → POST ke Better Auth `/api/auth/sign-in/email`
- `signup(name, email, password, role)` → POST ke Better Auth `/api/auth/sign-up/email`
- `logout()` → POST ke Better Auth `/api/auth/sign-out`
- `getSession()` → GET ke Better Auth `/api/auth/get-session` (cek cookie)
- `getCurrentUser()` → return cached user object with `role`
- `hasAccess(menuItemId)` → cek apakah current user role punya akses ke menu item tertentu
- `getDefaultRoute(role)` → return hash route default sesuai role
- Role-to-menu permission map (ROLE_PERMISSIONS constant)

